---
# ext-scarpe, ledger N1: Scarpe draws its own controls, so it tells a screen reader what they are.
testability: interactive
display: native
ledger: N1
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @said = para "waiting"
  @go = button("Go") { @said.replace "pressed" }
end
----------- test code
assert_equal "waiting", para("@said").text
a11y_action button("@go"), :click
assert_equal "pressed", para("@said").text, "a screen reader's press runs the block"
